@base = http://localhost:5082
@playerToken = paste-player-token
@raid = paste-raid-id
@reservation = paste-reservation-id
@futureUnix = replace-with-future-unix-timestamp

### Anonymous player credential
POST {{base}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Neo"}

### Create future raid; development admin key only
POST {{base}}/raids
X-Admin-Key: local-demo-admin-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Legendary raid","capacity":1,"startsAt":{{futureUnix}}}

### Book; replay with same key returns same reservation
POST {{base}}/raids/{{raid}}/reservations
X-Player-Token: {{playerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: local-demo-booking-1

### Cancel; repeating is safe
DELETE {{base}}/reservations/{{reservation}}
X-Player-Token: {{playerToken}}
